hat the Code of Ordinances, of the City of Santa Claus, is hereby amended to read as follows:

Days and hours of closing.

No licensee shall sell or offer for sale any alcoholic beverage at any of the following times:

- (1) On any day or during any time of day when such sales are prohibited by state law;

- (2) On Sundays except between the hours of 12:30 p.m, and 11:30 p.m.;

- (3) At any time in violation of a local ordinance or regulation or of a special order of the council;

- (4) On Monday through Friday after 2:00 a.m. or before 8:00 a.m.; on Saturday after12:00 midnight or before 8:00 a.m.

- (5) At any time on Christmas Day;

- (6) On premises consumption on Thanksgiving Day after 2:00 a.m. or before 6:00 p.m.

- (7) Notwithstanding any provision otherwise contained in this article, no retail dealer shall sell or offer for sale any distilled spirits in violation of Department of Revenue Rule 560-2-3-.38. This subsection shall not contradict or supersede any such revenue department or regulation.”
